 camp) though – it can feel remote but technically it's not. Lots of public land on both sides of the river, on and off, though.\n\nDunsmuir is a cool little river town (not as beloved by some locals, though) and offers some accommodations, food, and other resources – the town of Mt. Shasta is the 'big city' round here a bit further up the highway.\n\n**Other resources:**\n\n- [CACreeks](https://cacreeks.com/sac-dun.htm)","averageGradient":"43","maxGradient":null,"length":"7.4","correlations":[{"reachID":"276","isPrimary":true,"correlationDetails":{"metric":"cfs","belowRecommendedRangeComment":null,"lowRunnableRangeComment":null,"mediumRunnableRangeComment":null,"highRunnableRangeComment":null,"aboveRecommendedRangeComment":null,"lowRunnableAdjustedDifficulty":null,"highRunnableAdjustedDifficulty":null,"beginLowRunnable":"500","beginMediumRunnable":"800","beginHighRunnable":"1200","endHighRunnable":"3000"},"gaugeInfo":{"name":"SACRAMENTO RIVER AT DELTA ","gaugeSource":"CDEC","gaugeSourceIdentifier":"DLT","gaugeFetchStatus":"ACTIVE","latestFlowReading":{"value":"671","dateTime":"2026-05-12T01:30:00.000Z","qualifier":"NORMAL"},"latestStageReading":{"value":"4.89","dateTime":"2026-05-12T01:30:00.000Z","qualifier":"NORMAL"},"location":{"latitude":"40.9395942687988","longitude":"-122.417236328125"},"externalSourceLinks":{"sourceLink":{"url":"https://cdec.water.ca.gov/dynamicapp/QueryF?s=DLT","text":"California Data Exchange - Station Log"},"secondaryLink":{"url":"https://cdec.water.ca.gov/cdecplotter/JspPlotAll?staid_id=DLT","text":"California Data Exchange - Data Plot"}}},"migrationErrorExplanation":null,"comment":null,"status":{"status":"low-runnable","latestReading":{"value":"671","dateTime":"2026-05-12T01:30:00.000Z","qualifier":"NORMAL"},"metric":"cfs","adjustedDifficulty":null}}],"pointOfInterestIDs":["110008","115262"],"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[-122.279376,41.226196],[-122.27942,41.226151],[-122.279624,41.225739],[-122.279763,41.225368],[-122